{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"7653aa64f11ed5e86b64f5806ce4393d656010dca6eac643843bbaa97a4000ce","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的敗壞"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我真悲慘！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就像夏天的果子已被收盡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"葡萄已被摘淨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找不到一串可吃的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋不見我心中渴望的初熟無花果。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虔敬人已從大地上滅絕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世間再沒有正直人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人人伺機殺人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用網羅獵取自己的弟兄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們善於作惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領袖和審判官索要賄賂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"顯貴袒露心中的惡慾，朋比為奸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們當中最好的不過是蒺藜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"最正直的也不過是荊棘籬笆。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的守望者所說的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是你們受懲罰的日子已經來到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必驚慌失措。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"不要相信鄰居，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要信賴朋友，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使對你懷中的妻子也要守口如瓶。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為兒子藐視父親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"女兒與母親作對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"媳婦與婆婆作對；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"家人之間反目成仇。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"至於我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要仰望耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等候拯救我的上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的上帝必垂聽我的祈求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仇敵啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不要對我幸災樂禍！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我雖跌倒，但必再起來；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我雖坐在黑暗裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但耶和華必做我的光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我得罪了耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以要承受祂的怒氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到祂為我辯護，替我伸冤。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必領我進入光明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必親睹祂的公義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的仇敵見狀都必滿面羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們曾問我：「你的上帝耶和華在哪裡？」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必親眼看見他們遭到報應，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要像街上的泥土一樣被人踐踏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"終有一日你會重建自己的城牆。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，你必擴張自己的疆域。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日，從亞述到埃及的各城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從埃及到幼發拉底河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從天涯到海角","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們都要到你這裡來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，大地要因地上居民的惡行而荒涼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你用你的杖牧養你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是那作你產業的群羊。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們獨自住在林中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在肥沃的田園間。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們像從前一樣放養在巴珊和基列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我要向他們顯出神蹟奇事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像他們離開埃及時一樣。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國看見這一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必因自己勢力衰微而羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必用手捂口，耳朵變聾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要像蛇一樣舔土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如地上的爬蟲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰戰兢兢地走出營寨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必畏懼我們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必對你充滿恐懼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有何神明像你一樣赦免罪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"饒恕你倖存子民的過犯？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不會永遠發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你樂於施恩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必再次憐憫我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將我們的罪惡踐踏在腳下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我們的一切過犯拋進深海。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必按古時給我們列祖的誓言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以信實待雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以慈愛待亞伯拉罕。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「從天涯到海角」希伯來文是「從海到海，從山到山」。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/NAM/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":20}